  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">(30 fotos) Aquest diumenge,&nbsp;7 d&#39;agost, s&#39;ha produ&iuml;t al Sal&oacute; de Plens de l&#39;Ajuntament de Suera el nomenament oficial&nbsp;com a reina infantil de les festes 2016 de Carlota Quiroga Mar&iacute;n, que substituir&agrave; en el c&agrave;rrec a Estela Le&oacute;n Garcia.</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/08/IMG_2862.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.6667px; line-height: 21.3333px;\">La proclamaci&oacute; ser&aacute; divendres 12 d&#39;agost, primer dia de les festes patronals d&#39;estiu, al Sal&oacute; de la Font Seca, i Carlota tindr&agrave; com a acompanyant a enric Garcia Mar&iacute;n. A l&#39;acte d&#39;aquest diumenge ha assistit una bona part de la Coporaci&oacute; Municipal, encap&ccedil;alada per l&#39;alcalde, Jos&eacute; Pascual Mart&iacute; Garcia. Tamb&eacute; hi havia una representaci&oacute; de la Comisssi&oacute; de Festes, &nbsp;a m&eacute;s de familiars i amistats. Mentrestant, la Comissi&oacute; de Festes contin&uacute;a treballant perqu&egrave; siguen ben llu&iuml;des.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinainfantilsuera16/img_2848.jpg\" alt=\"img_2848\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinainfantilsuera16/img_2849.jpg\" alt=\"img_2849\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinainfantilsuera16/img_2850.jpg\" alt=\"img_2850\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/nomenamentreinainfantilsuera16/img_28